   SummaryDo you like to be active and want a stable job with growth opportunities? Become a Warehouse Worker in Heijen! Work Monday to Friday in a 3-shift system, earn up to € 20,96 per hour and get the opportunity to get your own combitruck certificate
About the jobNo day is the same in this warehouse! As a Warehouse Worker, you are an important part of the logistics team and help ensure that all goods move smoothly and reach the right place on time.
Your tasks as a Warehouse Worker:
- Pick orders using a combitruck (training provided);
- Receive and prepare goods for shipping;
- Check stock and keep the warehouse clean and safe;
- Work together with colleagues to keep the warehouse running well.

Working hours - 3 shifts:
- Morning: 06:00 - 14:00;
- Afternoon: 14:00 - 22:00;
- Night: 22:00 - 06:00.

What we offer- A gross hourly wage of € 17,25 including allowance;
- Growth opportunities up to € 20,96 gross per hour;
- 1,38% ADV allowance on top of your salary;
- Travel allowance from 10 km (€ 0,23 per km);
- 25 vacation days + 8% holiday allowance;
- Pension from day one;
- Free training opportunities (like your high-bay truck certificate);
- Personal support and chances to grow within the company (Supervisor, Logistics Team Leader);
- Weekly or 4-weekly payments, it's up to you.

What we ask- You can speak the English language;
- You are not afraid of hights 

